--- not applicable cases ---
With p_key (normal projection, hypothetical):
reason: Projection sort key cannot filter this predicate (always unknown or true)
With p_agg (aggregate projection, hypothetical):
reason: EXPLAIN WHATIF estimates normal (sorted) hypothetical projections only, aggregate projections are not estimated yet
With p_where (normal projection, hypothetical):
reason: EXPLAIN WHATIF does not estimate projections with a WHERE clause yet
With p_nocol (normal projection, hypothetical):
reason: Projection does not contain column v required by the query, so it could only filter the base table\'s parts, which EXPLAIN WHATIF does not estimate yet
With p_skipidx (normal projection, hypothetical):
reason: EXPLAIN WHATIF does not estimate projections with their own skip indexes yet
